{
  "company_name": "MidSpend Analytics",
  "industry": "Oil & Gas Midstream",
  "use_case": "Procurement spend intelligence and supplier management",
  "space_title": "MidSpend Analytics - Spend Intelligence 💰",
  "space_description": "**Subindustry:** Oil & Gas Midstream\n\n**Use case:** Spend Intelligence & Supplier Management\n\nMidSpend Analytics — procurement spend analytics across categories, suppliers, and risk tiers for a midstream operator. Procurement VPs use this space to identify savings opportunities, reduce maverick spend, and rationalize the supplier base; category managers and operations use it to monitor supplier quality, on-time delivery, and contract compliance.\n\n**Key KPIs**\n- Total spend ($) — addressable procurement spend\n- Savings ($) — realized cost reductions vs. baseline\n- Maverick spend (%) — off-contract spend (target <5%)\n- Contract compliance (%) — % of spend on contracted terms\n- Supplier quality score (0-100) — composite supplier scorecard\n- On-time delivery (%) — supplier OTD (target >95%)\n- Defect rate (%) — supplier quality issues (target <2%)\n- Avg lead time (days) — supplier responsiveness\n\n**Data sources**\n- `procurement_transactions` — individual POs / invoices with supplier and category\n- `supplier_snapshots` — periodic quality, OTD, defect, lead-time scorecard\n- `spend_kpi_monthly` — monthly spend, savings, maverick-spend rollups",
  "schema_basename": "og_midstream_spend",
