  "genie_instructions": "DOMAIN CONTEXT\nThis space supports Spend Intelligence & Supplier Management for a midstream operator's procurement organization spanning pipe and steel, compressor equipment, MRO, professional services, and field services. Stakeholders include the VP Procurement (category strategy, savings targets), Category Managers (supplier rationalization, contract compliance), Operations leadership (supplier OTD on critical-path items), and Risk (supplier financial and cyber risk tiers). Industry context: best-in-class procurement organizations deliver 3-5% annualized savings, run maverick spend <5%, and maintain >95% contract compliance.\n\nMETRIC DEFINITIONS\n- Total spend = total_spend_usd on procurement_transactions metric view\n- Savings = savings_usd on spend_kpi_monthly; target 3-5% of addressable spend\n- Maverick spend = maverick_spend_pct on spend_kpi_monthly; target <5%\n- Contract compliance = contract_compliance_pct on procurement_transactions; target >95%\n- Supplier quality score = quality_score on supplier_snapshots (0-100)\n- On-time delivery = on_time_delivery_pct on supplier_snapshots; target >95%\n- Defect rate = defect_rate_pct on supplier_snapshots; target <2%\n- Lead time = avg_lead_time_days; benchmark varies by category\n\nQUERY GUIDANCE\n- ALWAYS prefer metric views with MEASURE() syntax for aggregations.\n  - procurement_transactions_metrics (source: procurement_transactions) — dims: transaction_date, supplier_id, spend_category, risk_tier, document_type; measures: total_spend_usd, total_transactions, avg_compliance_pct, avg_delivery_days, max_amount.\n  - supplier_snapshots_metrics (source: supplier_snapshots) — dims: snapshot_date, supplier_id, spend_category, risk_tier; measures: avg_quality_score, avg_on_time_pct, avg_defect_rate, avg_lead_time, max_quality_score.\n- Use GROUP BY ALL with MEASURE() queries.\n- For monthly trends, always wrap the date in DATE_TRUNC('month', <date_col>).\n- For \"Top X\" requests, return LIMIT 10 unless the user specifies otherwise.\n- Query base tables directly only when needing columns not exposed by metric views (e.g. supplier_name, contract_compliance_pct, savings_usd, maverick_spend_pct, invoice_accuracy_pct).\n- When the user's phrasing matches a SQL snippet display name (filters, expressions, or measures), prefer that snippet.",
  "sample_questions": [
    "Show monthly total spend by spend category for the trailing 12 months.",
    "Top 10 suppliers by total spend year-to-date.",
    "Which suppliers have a quality score below 70, and what is their on-time delivery percentage?",
    "How has maverick spend percentage trended month-over-month across the company?",
    "Top 10 suppliers by total realized savings this year.",
    "Which spend categories carry the most High risk-tier exposure, and what is the total spend?",
    "What is the average lead time by spend category, and how has it trended monthly?"
  ],
  "example_sqls": [
    {
      "question": "How has total spend trended over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT transaction_date, MEASURE(total_spend_usd) AS total_spend_usd",
        "FROM {fqn}.procurement_transactions_metrics",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY transaction_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has average contract compliance changed over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT transaction_date, MEASURE(avg_compliance_pct) AS avg_compliance_pct",
        "FROM {fqn}.procurement_transactions_metrics",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY transaction_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the monthly trend in average on-time delivery?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT DATE_TRUNC('month', snapshot_date) AS month, MEASURE(avg_on_time_pct) AS avg_on_time_pct",
        "FROM {fqn}.supplier_snapshots_metrics",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY month"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has total transaction amount trended over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT transaction_date, SUM(amount_usd) AS total_amount_usd",
        "FROM {fqn}.procurement_transactions",
        "GROUP BY transaction_date",
        "ORDER BY transaction_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the trend of total average lead time days over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT snapshot_date, SUM(avg_lead_time_days) AS total_avg_lead_time_days",
        "FROM {fqn}.supplier_snapshots",
        "GROUP BY snapshot_date ORDER BY snapshot_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has average off-contract spend percentage trended by month?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT kpi_month, AVG(maverick_spend_pct) AS avg_maverick_spend_pct",
        "FROM {fqn}.spend_kpi_monthly",
        "GROUP BY kpi_month",
        "ORDER BY kpi_month"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "Which suppliers have the most transactions?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT supplier_name, COUNT(DISTINCT transaction_id) AS transaction_count",
        "FROM {fqn}.spend_transactions",
        "GROUP BY supplier_name",
        "ORDER BY transaction_count DESC",
        "LIMIT 10"
      ]
    }
  ],
